# The build context is the workspace root, because the lockfile and the workspace
# list live there.
#
# Two things are deliberately NOT excluded:
#
# `examples/full/bunfig.toml` carries the `@dunx/transform` preload, which is a
# runtime input rather than a build-time one - the container transpiles from
# source at every boot, and without the preload it starts and then dies naming a
# provider whose constructor it could not read. Bun reads bunfig.toml from the
# process cwd and does not walk up, so the root copy cannot stand in for it.
#
# Every workspace directory named in `bun.lock`, including `internal/*`. A
# `--frozen-lockfile` install refuses a checkout where a workspace it reads is
# missing on disk, and `@dunx/dashboard`'s build shells into
# `internal/dashboard-ui/scripts/build.ts`.

# Reinstalled in the image from the lockfile
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Built inside the image
dist
**/dist
internal/docs/src/generated
internal/docs/public/badges

# Git, CI and editor state
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode

# Coverage and test output
coverage
*.lcov
**/tmp
**/cli-fixture-*
**/.sandbox-child-*

# Local environment and databases
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
